\"db37867f-0a32-4228-a6ab-2a9cd145a4fc\"\n  }\n}\n\n受管身份：{\"command\":\"submit\",\"task\":\"fixture-20261014-1\",\"attempt\":\"8e8554f1-d8db-461d-9653-72ec5db5ebf9\",\"session\":\"907230ad-4813-4bfe-8efc-753397af7bd8\",\"fence\":1,\"spec_rev\":1,\"commit\":\"<FULL_COMMIT_SHA>\"}\nGit 写操作：把执行工具的工作目录设为本 attempt 的 worktree。git add <路径> 和 git commit … 必须各自作为一条独立的工具命令执行；不要与 cd、检查命令或彼此用 &&、分号、管道、换行、变量赋值或重定向拼接。git status、git diff、测试和 git rev-parse 另行执行。两条 Git 前缀 allow 规则只授权对应命令；若独立执行仍被沙箱拒绝，上报问题并结束，不重试或修改权限。\n完成并 Git 提交后，把 FULL_COMMIT_SHA 换成完整提交号，运行以下 CLI 显式交付：\n'/opt/homebrew/Cellar/node/26.5.0/bin/node' '/private/tmp/t80f-qyz3m9ti/source/workbench/src/gates/cli.ts' '--state' '/private/tmp/q76-6jhvfjy9/c-9uypo8zs/state' 'submit' '--task' 'fixture-20261014-1' '--attempt' '8e8554f1-d8db-461d-9653-72ec5db5ebf9' '--session' '907230ad-4813-4bfe-8efc-753397af7bd8' '--fence' '1' '--spec-rev' '1' '--commit' 'FULL_COMMIT_SHA'\n本会话的 CLI 会将 submit、status、issue 请求写到 A2A_REQUEST_DIR 指向的本 attempt 专用 /tmp 目录；不直接连接 socket。queued=true 只表示已排队，不是门禁通过。最后结束回合，让 Stop hook 读取并转交；没有请求文件就不交付。请求文件不得进入 Git 提交。查状态用同一入口 status --task，问题上报用 issue --task --title --body。不要修改合同、验收程序或沙箱权限。"}},{"seq":27,"time":"2026-10-14T18:25:18.520Z","task":"fixture-20261014-1","attempt":"8e8554f1-d8db-461d-9653-72ec5db5ebf9","type":"dispatched","details":{"attempt":{"task_id":"fixture-20261014-1","attempt_id":"8e8554f1-d8db-461d-9653-72ec5db5ebf9","session_id":"907230ad-4813-4bfe-8efc-753397af7bd8","fence":1,"spec_rev":1,"thread_id":"db37867f-0a32-4228-a6ab-2a9cd145a4fc","runtime_mode":"workspace-write","turn_id":null,"runtime_identity":{"launch":"768d9e6a-4680-4bf6-bad7-7ef01075cd93","thread":"db37867f-0a32-4228-a6ab-2a9cd145a4fc","shell_pid":31000,"leader_pid":31001,"native_session":"fixture-native-768d9e6a-4680-4bf6-bad7-7ef01075cd93"},"workspace":"/private/tmp/q76-6jhvfjy9/c-9uypo8zs/state/worktrees/fixture/fixture-20261014-1-a1","base_commit":"940a76632ffc9c271960e7aa6fb3e5f01ccfff79","card_snapshot_id":"ca430171-6